The receptionist typing waveform is derived from "Keyboard typing" by
Breviceps, Freesound sound 447909, published 2018-11-14:
https://freesound.org/people/Breviceps/sounds/447909/

The creator published the recording under Creative Commons Zero (CC0 1.0),
dedicating it to the public domain. CC0 permits copying, modification,
distribution, and commercial use without permission:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

The retrieved high-quality Freesound preview was downmixed to mono, resampled
to 8,000 Hz, attenuated by 16 dB, and padded to exactly 4.000 seconds for the
telephone path. The source preview SHA-256 is
9777520f7b6a68f2b33104ee908437a78c434fb643a3038fab3fbdf235a848c5.
The transformed WAV SHA-256 is
db4198f9d1d25748593588b3ceda9079c287873f1e932740914602b82936ac38.

The asset contains no speech or caller identifiers.
